title: Theme Toggle for SSG - No Flash!
summary: >-
  Theme toggles for SSG are the trickiest to implement. We can't build a page with the
  correct theme before we send the HTML (like an SSR), and we also have the full content
  of the page and can't fallback to the transparency of the body for a default color.
  Fear not, there is a way to get a perfect theme toggle with SSG!
